  #|["markdown","表格和代码 082947\n\n| 页面 | 状态 | 耗时 |\n|:--|:-:|--:|\n| 首页 | 完成 | 1.2 s |\n| 聊天页的列表和输入框 | 进行中 | 3.4 s |\n\n```ts\nexport function placeRows(rows: Row[], from: number): number {\n  const visible = rows.filter((r) => r.top >= from && r.top < from + window.innerHeight * 2) // only the rows near the screen\n  return visible.length\n}\n```\n\n详见 https://example.com/e2e/082947",[["p",[[0,12]]],["table",[["tr",[["th",[[16,18]]],["th",[[21,23]]],["th",[[26,28]]]]],["tr",[["td",[[47,49]]],["td",[[52,54]]],["td",[[57,62]]]]],["tr",[["td",[[67,77]]],["td",[[80,83]]],["td",[[86,91]]]]]],{"align":["left","center","right"],"md":"| 页面 | 状态 | 耗时 |\n| :-- | :-: | --: |\n| 首页 | 完成 | 1.2 s |\n| 聊天页的列表和输入框 | 进行中 | 3.4 s |","csv":"页面,状态,耗时\n首页,完成,1.2 s\n聊天页的列表和输入框,进行中,3.4 s"}],["pre",{"code":[101,315],"lang":"ts","ink":"g7h9i9cj4c2l3c4g4c2l6c3l7c4h6j8c2j4ci6c2jc5jcj4h3g5h3jcj4h2g5h2j6cj12h2fc2b35g7j7cj7c"}],["p",[[321,324],["a",[[324,354]],{"href":"https://example.com/e2e/082947","bare":true}]]]]]
